Make sure all types of roadways are shown intersections, map edge crossings, location etc -- they aren't:
"Unnamed roads and paths lose all three details during summarization.
Roads are aggregated by surface type; paths by their subtype. Those summaries retain counts and lengths, and roads retain surface information, but discard spatial and connection details—even when there is just one unnamed feature.
For example, an unnamed footpath with a known location, edge crossing, and connection to “Cross Street” produces only:
1 unnamed footpath / trail, 100 meters

I verified this across all 12 road/path subclasses, including service roads, tracks, cycleways, pedestrian streets, and steps/ramps. The distinction is primarily named versus unnamed, not a particular roadway type. See [summary rendering (line 1509)](/home/hippo/git/touch-mapper/web/src/scripts/map-desc-ways.js:1509)."
